claim.claim-text:
an air channel extending from an air inlet for the cartridge to an outlet via an aerosol generation region;
a reservoir for containing aerosolisable material for aerosolising;
an aerosol outlet tube, extending between the aerosol generating region and the outlet, for directing aerosol generated in the aerosol generating region through to the outlet; and
at least one contoured surface located on a surface of the cartridge, wherein the contoured surface is located in the reservoir.
